<title>CHINA: China June CPI at 2.8 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China June CPI at 2.8 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's consumer price inflation in June rose by a year-on-year 2.8 percent, the same level as in May, the Xinhua news agency on Tuesday quoted the State Statistical Bureau as saying.</p>
<p>Consumer price inflation for the first half was 4.1 percent, the bureau has said.</p>
</text>
